From: Yang Tsao <yang@fydeos.io>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 16:59:51 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 75/75] fydroid: ask ARC's app-install policy (ArcInstallGate)
 before installing, so a blocked app is refused instead of installed and
 disabled

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Change-Id: I8f7b9ae4b64cabb3c1caf3985bd4d326923e1afa
---
 .../com/android/server/pm/ArcInstallGate.java | 44 ++++++++++++++++++
 .../server/pm/PackageInstallerSession.java    | 45 +++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 89 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 services/core/java/com/android/server/pm/ArcInstallGate.java

